  "extract": "Kevin Kwan is a Singaporean-born American novelist and writer of satirical novels Crazy Rich Asians, China Rich Girlfriend, and Rich People Problems. His latest book, Lies and Weddings, was released in June 2024.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Kevin Kwan</b> is a Singaporean-born American novelist and writer of satirical novels <i>Crazy Rich Asians</i>, <i>China Rich Girlfriend</i>, and <i>Rich People Problems</i>. His latest book, <i>Lies and Weddings</i>, was released in June 2024.</p>"
